<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Martin Luther</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Yuno Miles</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Martin Luther</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6UQBF5uP5wr6hNXlwzprjS</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.110" end="00:21.610">Shout out Martin Luther King</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.480" end="00:24.540">That nigga had a dre-e-e-e-e-e-e-eam</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.540" end="00:26.790">Fuck do you me-e-e-e-e-e-e-ean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.790" end="00:29.230">That nigga had a dre-e-e-e-e-e-e-eam</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.230" end="00:31.080">Martin Luther Ki-i-i-ing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.080" end="00:33.310">Ay, Martin Luther King, shout out to big bro</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.310" end="00:36.060">If it wasn't for big bro I wouldn't be rappin' tho'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.060" end="00:38.550">If it wasn't for him I wouldn't even be here rappin' this shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.550" end="00:41.060">Trappin' this shit, stealin' shit, for my family and shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.060" end="00:44.420">Can't forget about Malcolm Eh-eh-eh-eh-eh-eh-eh-eh-X</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.420" end="00:47.150">And Rosa Pa-a-a-a-a-a-arks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.150" end="00:49.430">I feel like we made it out the pa-a-a-ark</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.430" end="00:52.620">But it don't matter because I'm Martin Luther Ki-i-i-i-i-ing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.620" end="00:54.940">That nigga had a dre-e-e-e-e-e-eam</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.940" end="00:57.500">Fuck do you me-e-e-e-e-e-ean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.500" end="00:59.000">That nigga had a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.600" end="01:01.610">That I started rappin' so that's what I did, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.610" end="01:03.110">Shout out Martin Luther King</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.820" end="01:05.740">That nigga had a dre-e-e-e-e-e-e-eam</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.740" end="01:08.090">Fuck do you me-e-e-e-e-e-e-ean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.090" end="01:10.480">That nigga had a dre-e-e-e-e-e-e-eam</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.480" end="01:12.170">Martin Luther Ki-i-i-ing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.170" end="01:16.170" /></div></body></tt>